# Mutation Testing — Triage + Fix (mt-fix.md)

**Skill scope:** Triage + inline test fix + ratchet verdict + complete. Consumes the session file produced by `mt.md`.

**Companion skill:** `/midtempo-framework/mt.md` (pre-triage — scope + run + capture + equivalent pre-pass + cluster + sort). Run `mt.md` first.

---

## Overview

This skill runs the **triage + fix** half of an MT session:

1. Reads `planning/mt-session.md` (produced by `mt.md`); requires `Status: ready-for-triage` or `triage-in-progress`.
2. Per file (heuristic order by file-prior): analyse each cluster silently, present the finding to the human, apply the chosen action (inline test fix / ignore / push bug to manifest), verify, advance.
3. Compute ratchet verdict at end of triage.
4. Emit All Complete output; archive the session file.

May edit test code inline. Never edits production code. Production-bug findings push to `planning/mt-fix-manifest.md` for later `bugs.md` follow-up.

**Session-file schema:** see [`/midtempo-framework/templates/mt-session.md`](templates/mt-session.md). The template is authoritative for field definitions, section ownership, state enum, ID conventions (M-IDs, C-IDs, D-IDs, MT-IDs), and human manual-edit rules.

**Outputs:**

- Inline test edits verified by `{{ "test" | cmd }} <path>`
- Bug entries appended to `planning/mt-fix-manifest.md`
- Ratchet verdict written to `planning/mt-session.md`
- Archived session: `planning/mt-session.md` → `planning/archive/mt-session-<timestamp>.md`
- Copy-pasteable commit message + grouped-by-file bug-fix session suggestions

**Not produced by this skill:**

- Changes to production code, mutation-tool configuration, package manifests, or CI configuration
- New mutation runs (those live in `mt.md`)

