## Step 8 — All Complete Output

<CRITICAL_REQUIREMENT type="MANDATORY">

- You MUST produce this output exactly. Do not skip, paraphrase, or omit any section.
- You MUST set Status: triage-complete and archive the session file before exiting.
- You MUST prompt the human about design-doc updates when any blocking-severity production bug was recorded.

</CRITICAL_REQUIREMENT>

### 8.1 Design-doc review (conditional)

```
IF ≥1 mutant with Classification: production bug AND Severity: blocking
  → Record an Open-Handoffs entry:
    "Review design doc <path> — blocking bug(s) imply gaps in §1/§2/§3/§4.
     Mutants: <M-IDs>. Open the doc and update if the assumptions changed."
ELSE
  → Skip 8.1.
```

### 8.2 Archive

```
1. Set Status: triage-complete in planning/mt-session.md
2. Move file to planning/archive/mt-session-<YYYYMMDD-HHMM>.md
3. Create planning/archive/ if absent
```

### 8.3 Emit the output

```
MT SESSION COMPLETE

Resolved scope: <git range or path filter>
Source design doc: <path or "—">
